	<relatedMatch xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" rdf:resource="http://data.europa.eu/xsp/cn2026/283327000080"/>
</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/qw1/prodcom2026/note_20.15">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://rdf-vocabulary.ddialliance.org/xkos#ExplanatoryNote"/>
	<identifier xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">note_20.15</identifier>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">Fertilizers</prefLabel>
	<modified xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2025-01-07</modified>
	<created xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2025-01-07</created>
	<language xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/ENG"/>
	<plainText xmlns="http://rdf-vocabulary.ddialliance.org/xkos#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#PlainLiteral">For these fertilizers "kilo" means kilo product or kilo material measured by weight. 
In other words, 1 kilo of product / material will have a certain nutrient content and the rest will be made up of other components. For instance, 1 kilo of product / material of compound fertilizer, so-called NPK, of the type "15-15-15" will have a nitrogen (N) content of 150 grams, a phosphate (P2O5) content of 150 grams and a potash (K2O) content of 150 grams. Hence, the nutrient content in a kilo of this fertilizer type adds up to 450 grams and the remaining 550 grams are non-nutrient components.</plainText>
</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/qw1/prodcom2026/note_R">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://rdf-vocabulary.ddialliance.org/xkos#ExplanatoryNote"/>
	<identifier xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">note_R</identifier>
	<notation xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#">R</notation>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">R Repairs and refitting</prefLabel>
	<modified xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2025-01-08</modified>
	<created xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2025-01-07</created>
	<language xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/ENG"/>
	<plainText xmlns="http://rdf-vocabulary.ddialliance.org/xkos#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#PlainLiteral">Provisions on newly constructed ships .
These headings are exclusively for recording the construction of new ships. Repairs and refitting should be recorded under headings 30.11.91.00, 30.11.92.00 and 33.15.10.10.
</plainText>
</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/qw1/prodcom2026/note_O">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://rdf-vocabulary.ddialliance.org/xkos#ExplanatoryNote"/>
	<identifier xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">note_O</identifier>
	<notation xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#">O</notation>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">O Building of ships and floating structures</prefLabel>
	<modified xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2025-01-08</modified>
	<created xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2025-01-07</created>
	<language xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/ENG"/>
	<plainText xmlns="http://rdf-vocabulary.ddialliance.org/xkos#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#PlainLiteral">Considerations on the links to CN for ships.
For ships and vessels no reference to Combined Nomenclature is made for two main reasons:
1)	according to CESA (Community of European Shipyards Associations), comparison with CN data is much less important than comparison with data on changes of ownership
2)	the classification principle applied is different in CN and PRODCOM; CN makes a distinction between sea-going vessels and non sea-going vessels, whereas PRODCOM does not make such a distinction.
Since comparison with external trade date is considered unimportant, it was thought preferable not to link with CN, as this would have made it necessary to create "Z" codes, producing data which would be of little value.
</plainText>
</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/qw1/prodcom2026/note_M">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://rdf-vocabulary.ddialliance.org/xkos#ExplanatoryNote"/>
	<identifier xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">note_M</identifier>
	<notation xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#">M</notation>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">M Military products</prefLabel>
	<modified xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2025-01-08</modified>
	<created xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2025-01-07</created>
	<language xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/ENG"/>
	<plainText xmlns="http://rdf-vocabulary.ddialliance.org/xkos#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#PlainLiteral">Considerations on military products.
Some countries have very strict legal provisions prohibiting them from communicating data on military products; therefore, data collected via the PRODCOM survey will be limited to products, equipments and materials used for civil uses only. When the Combined Nomenclature makes a distinction between military products and other products, CN headings dealing with military products are omitted. When no such distinction is made, only the products for civil uses should be declared.</plainText>
</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/qw1/prodcom2026/note_2x.S2">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://rdf-vocabulary.ddialliance.org/xkos#ExplanatoryNote"/>
	<identifier xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">note_2x.S2</identifier>
	<notation xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#">S2</notation>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">S2 Supply of parts and accessories</prefLabel>
	<modified xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2025-01-08</modified>
	<created xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2025-01-07</created>
	<language xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/ENG"/>
	<plainText xmlns="http://rdf-vocabulary.ddialliance.org/xkos#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#PlainLiteral">Considerations on sub-contracting.
The production of suppliers is not to be reported under the above-mentioned headings but should be listed instead under the corresponding headings of NACE 2 classes:
22.29	Manufacture of other plastic products
24.51	Casting of iron
24.52	Casting of steel
24.53	Casting of light metals
24.54	Casting of other non-ferrous metals
25.50	Forging, pressing, stamping and roll-forming of metal; powder metallurgy
25.62	Machining
</plainText>
</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/qw1/prodcom2026/fn1">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://rdf-vocabulary.ddialliance.org/xkos#ExplanatoryNote"/>
	<identifier xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">fn1</identifier>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">* Modified heading of the List 2025</prefLabel>
	<modified xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2025-12-01</modified>
	<created xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2025-01-06</created>
	<language xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/ENG"/>
	<plainText xmlns="http://rdf-vocabulary.ddialliance.org/xkos#" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#PlainLiteral">Modified heading of the List 2025</plainText>
	<hiddenLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#">*</hiddenLabel>
</rdf:Description>

<rdf:Description rdf:about="http://data.europa.eu/qw1/prodcom2026/fn2">
	<rdf:type rdf:resource="http://rdf-vocabulary.ddialliance.org/xkos#ExplanatoryNote"/>
	<identifier xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">fn2</identifier>
	<prefLabel xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#" xml:lang="en">¤ Modified description of the List 2025</prefLabel>
	<modified xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2025-12-01</modified>
	<created xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date">2025-01-06</created>
	<language xmlns="http://purl.org/dc/terms/" rdf:resource="http://publications.europa.eu/resource/authority/language/ENG"/>
